flowchart TD
    A[POST /api/reports/generate] --> B[Receive Project ID]

    B --> C[Check User Access]

    C --> D{Access Allowed?}

    D -- No --> E[Return 403 Forbidden]
    D -- Yes --> F[Fetch Project Details]

    F --> G[Fetch Targets]
    G --> H[Fetch Scan Results]
    H --> I[Fetch AI Recommendations]
    I --> J[Fetch Evidence Files]

    J --> K{Findings Available?}

    K -- No --> L[Generate Empty Security Summary]
    K -- Yes --> M[Generate Full Penetration Testing Report]

    L --> N[Export PDF]
    M --> N

    N --> O[Save Report File]
    O --> P[Return Report Download Link]